<title>CHINA: China's January-June cereal exports detailed.</title>
<headline>China's January-June cereal exports detailed.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following table shows cereal export figures from five major Chinese customs offices as well as the country of destination in January-June.</p>
<p>Details were provided by the General Administration of Customs of China.</p>
<p>Figures are in tonnes. Percentages represent the share of the total market. Percentages may not add up to 100 percent because details of some smaller export destinations and supplying countries have not been included.</p>
<p>------WHEAT</p>
<p>    June exports    170	 Jan-June total exports    190</p>
<p> CUSTOMS		June	 Pct	   Jan-June     Pct</p>
<p>    Beijing		0	 0.0		 19.8     10.4</p>
<p>    Manzhouli	  170     100.0		170.0     89.5</p>
<p>    Huangpu		0	 0.0		  0.2	0.1</p>
<p>DESTINATION</p>
<p>    Malaysia	     0	 0.0		  0.2	0.1</p>
<p>    Japan		  0	 0.0		 19.8     10.4</p>
<p>    Mongolia	   170     100.0		170.0     89.5</p>
<p>------BARLEY</p>
<p>    June exports	 0     Jan-June total exports    5,562</p>
<p> CUSTOMS		June	  Pct	   Jan-June   Pct</p>
<p>    Dalian		 0	 0.0	     5,562     100.0</p>
<p>DESTINATION</p>
<p>    North Korea	  0	 0.0	     5,562     100.0</p>
<p>------CORN</p>
<p>June exports  919,882  Jan-June total exports  2,012,221</p>
<p> CUSTOMS		 May	 Pct	   Jan-May	Pct</p>
