<p>    Shenyang	23,094	 2.5	   59,060	   2.9</p>
<p>    Shijiazhuang 153,272	16.7	  271,376	  13.5</p>
<p>DESTINATION</p>
<p>    South Korea  637,901	69.3	 938,843	   46.7</p>
<p>    Malaysia     103,617	11.3	 463,584	   23.0</p>
<p>    North Korea   95,229	10.4	 270,889	   13.5</p>
